      "text": "5.0\r\n5.1 Introduction to Big Data; Characteristics of Big Data (Volume, Velocity, \r\nVariety, Veracity, Value); Sources of Big Data; Traditional Data vs Big Data; \r\nApplications of Big Data in various domains such as healthcare, banking, social \r\nmedia and e-commerce.\r\n08\r\n5.2 Overview of Big Data Technologies; Hadoop Ecosystem; Hadoop \r\nDistributed File System (HDFS); MapReduce Framework; YARN \r\narchitecture and role in resource management.\r\n5.3 Introduction to Big Data Processing Frameworks; Apache Spark Overview; \r\nNoSQL Databases \u2013 Key-Value Stores, Column-Oriented Databases, \r\nDocument Databases, Graph Databases; Applications of Big Data Analytics \r\nin Business Intelligence and Decision Support Systems.\r\nTotal 39\r\nSuggested Learning Resources:\r\nText Books:\r\n1. Database System Concepts, VI edition, Korth, Slberchatz, Sudarshan, McGraw \u2013 Hill, 2010\r\n2. Fundamentals of Database Systems, VI Edition, Ramez Elmasri and Shamkant B. Navathe, \r\nPearson Education, 2011.\r\n3. Data Warehousing, IV Edition, Reema Thareja, Oxford University Press, 2009.\r\n4. Database Management Systems, III Edition, Raghu Ramakrishnan and Johannes Gehrke, \r\nMcGraw Hill Education, 2003.\r\n5. Big Data Analytics, I Edition, Seema Acharya, Subhasini Chellappan, Wiley India, 2015.\r\nReference Books:\r\n1. Database System Implementation, I Edition, Hector Garcia-Molina, Jeffrey D. Ullman, Jennifer \r\nWidom, Pearson / Prentice Hall, 1999.\r\n2. Database Systems: A Practical Approach to Design, Implementation and Management, IV Edition, \r\nThomas M. Connolly, Carolyn Begg, Pearson Ltd., 2004.\r\n3. The Data Warehouse Toolkit: The Definitive Guide to Dimensional Modeling, III Edition, Ralph \r\nKimball, Margy Ross, Wiley India, 2013.\r\n4. Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques, III Edition, Jiawei Han, Micheline Kamber, Jian Pei, \r\nMorgan Kaufmann, 2011.\r\nWeb Resources\r\n1. NPTEL course on Data Base Management System By Prof. Partha Pratim Das, Prof. Samiran \r\nChattopadhyay, IIT Kharagpur Data Base Management System - Course\r\n2. NPTEL course on Big Data Computing by By Prof. Rajiv Misra, IIT Patna Big Data Computing -\r\nCourse",
